From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: denchiklut <ollylut@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 04:14:01 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] oa: paste and match style for pasteAsPlainText:, as ArcCore
 does

RenderWidgetHostViewCocoa answers pasteAsPlainText:, the selector of AppKit's own Paste and Match Style item, with the same PasteAndMatchStyle as its pasteAndMatchStyle:, and enables it for a main frame's view as the other edit actions. ArcCore adds the method with the same implementation and the same validation; upstream has neither, so the item was disabled over a page.
---
 .../app_shim_remote_cocoa/render_widget_host_view_cocoa.mm   | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/content/app_shim_remote_cocoa/render_widget_host_view_cocoa.mm b/content/app_shim_remote_cocoa/render_widget_host_view_cocoa.mm
index c8ebb31f69c0b5d438c10e52afd31493709b6366..0f7d86e43800ccfbad23c9aa72b114e7a3a2388a 100644
--- a/content/app_shim_remote_cocoa/render_widget_host_view_cocoa.mm
+++ b/content/app_shim_remote_cocoa/render_widget_host_view_cocoa.mm
@@ -2337,6 +2337,7 @@ - (BOOL)validateUserInterfaceItem:(id<NSValidatedUserInterfaceItem>)item {
       action == @selector(cut:) || action == @selector(copy:) ||
       action == @selector(centerSelectionInVisibleArea:) ||
       action == @selector(copyToFindPboard:) || action == @selector(paste:) ||
+      action == @selector(pasteAsPlainText:) ||
       action == @selector(pasteAndMatchStyle:)) {
     return isForMainFrame;
   }
@@ -3006,6 +3007,10 @@ - (void)pasteAndMatchStyle:(id)sender {
   _host->PasteAndMatchStyle();
 }
 
+- (void)pasteAsPlainText:(id)sender {
+  _host->PasteAndMatchStyle();
+}
+
 - (void)selectAll:(id)sender {
   // editCommandHelper_ adds implementations for most NSResponder methods
   // dynamically. But the renderer side only sends selection results back to
